.TH common n 0.23.0 tclutils "Tcl Library Procedures"
.SH NAME
common \- Internal shared helper package for tclutils.
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
.nf
::tclutils::common::readFile path
::tclutils::common::readBinaryFile path
::tclutils::common::writeFile path data ?mode?
::tclutils::common::splitLines text
::tclutils::common::splitDelimited line delimiter
::tclutils::common::parseOptions defaults ?option value ...?
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The file helpers use Tcl 8.6 \fBtry ... finally\fR, so opened channels are closed
.PP
again even if \fBread\fR, \fBwrite\fR, or later processing fails.
.PP
\fBreadBinaryFile\fR explicitly configures binary translation and binary encoding.
.PP
This matters for modules such as \fBtustrings\fR and \fBtuhexdump\fR.
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\fBsplitDelimited\fR supports both one\-character and multi\-character delimiters.
.PP
It is used by \fBtucut\fR and \fBtujoin\fR, replacing duplicated private \fB_split\fR
.PP
implementations.

